1
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:29,946
TAKE CHARGE OF MY HEART

2
00:01:03,855 --> 00:01:04,856
Ms. Na.

3
00:01:06,024 --> 00:01:08,318
I don't want to protect you anymore.

4
00:01:09,611 --> 00:01:10,445
What?

5
00:01:10,528 --> 00:01:11,654
I…

6
00:01:16,117 --> 00:01:17,452
want you to be mine.

7
00:01:55,865 --> 00:01:57,659
What's with this damn slow motion?

8
00:01:58,284 --> 00:02:00,662
When's he going to kiss me?

9
00:02:08,211 --> 00:02:09,254
Damn it.

10
00:02:12,298 --> 00:02:13,133
Huh?

11
00:02:13,633 --> 00:02:15,885
Is this what lips feel like?

12
00:02:29,357 --> 00:02:32,277
What? I was dreaming about my own script?

13
00:02:33,611 --> 00:02:34,821
Oh man.

14
00:02:34,904 --> 00:02:38,116
Even in my dreams, I can't get anywhere.

15
00:02:38,199 --> 00:02:40,910
Can't I at least get a kiss?

16
00:02:43,246 --> 00:02:44,164
Shoot.

17
00:02:49,252 --> 00:02:54,841
If I were the main character in a drama,
this is how I'd be introduced.

18
00:03:00,388 --> 00:03:02,015
-Na Bo-bae, get ready now.
-Okay!

19
00:03:06,561 --> 00:03:08,229
Name, Na Bo-bae.

20
00:03:08,730 --> 00:03:12,901
A woman nearing 30
with an uncertain future ahead of her.

21
00:03:16,779 --> 00:03:18,448
Ji-hye, where's that thing?

22
00:03:18,531 --> 00:03:20,325
You know, my checkered hoodie?

23
00:03:20,825 --> 00:03:22,535
Oh, that? I hung it outside.

24
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:27,874
My older sister, a soon-to-be-married
former national tae kwon do champion.

25
00:03:27,957 --> 00:03:29,584
Hey, Yong-gi!

26
00:03:29,667 --> 00:03:31,294
-Yeah?
-Yong-gi, give me that!

27
00:03:31,377 --> 00:03:32,378
-This?
-Yeah.

28
00:03:32,462 --> 00:03:33,504
Here.

29
00:03:34,756 --> 00:03:38,051
My older brother, a former national judoka
who now runs his own dojo.

30
00:03:38,635 --> 00:03:39,469
Then there's me,

31
00:03:39,969 --> 00:03:43,848
the youngest and the only writer
in a family of athletes.

32
00:03:43,932 --> 00:03:45,850
CONTEST AWARD
ONE-EP DRAMA (WISTFUL YOUTH)

33
00:03:48,895 --> 00:03:52,565
I grew up surrounded by my family's love
despite being the odd one out, but…

34
00:03:54,484 --> 00:03:55,902
I'm heading out!

35
00:03:55,985 --> 00:03:57,528
-You're leaving?
-Yeah.

36
00:03:58,196 --> 00:04:00,823
You're pushing 30.
How are you still always late for work?

37
00:04:00,907 --> 00:04:02,242
Hey, Ji-hye. The bread.

38
00:04:02,325 --> 00:04:03,826
I can't eat. My stomach hurts.

39
00:04:03,910 --> 00:04:05,828
What do you mean? Just eat it on the way.

40
00:04:05,912 --> 00:04:07,247
-My stomach hurts.
-Eat it.

41
00:04:07,330 --> 00:04:08,456
-Just chew it.
-I'm off.

42
00:04:08,539 --> 00:04:09,374
All right.

43
00:04:11,209 --> 00:04:15,088
I left home after boldly declaring
I'd move back in with my parents

44
00:04:15,171 --> 00:04:17,924
if I didn't make it as a drama writer
before turning 30.

45
00:04:18,007 --> 00:04:19,425
Go crush it, Writer Na Bo-bae!

46
00:04:21,928 --> 00:04:24,722
Now, I'm walking a tightrope,

47
00:04:24,806 --> 00:04:27,141
on the verge of becoming a total failure.

48
00:04:35,108 --> 00:04:36,734
Ugh, what's wrong with me?

49
00:04:50,248 --> 00:04:51,207
Huh?

50
00:04:51,791 --> 00:04:52,709
Oh…

51
00:05:35,710 --> 00:05:38,880
Wow, he's exceptionally good-looking.

52
00:05:40,089 --> 00:05:43,301
A guy like him would be perfect
for my male lead.

53
00:05:44,302 --> 00:05:47,305
Oh, I meant I wanted him
as the male lead in my script,

54
00:05:47,388 --> 00:05:49,849
not the male lead in my life.

55
00:06:05,073 --> 00:06:07,241
Are you okay?

56
00:06:08,451 --> 00:06:09,869
If this were a drama,

57
00:06:10,370 --> 00:06:12,830
this would definitely be the start
of a romance.

58
00:06:15,541 --> 00:06:17,418
But for me, this genre

59
00:06:19,045 --> 00:06:20,421
is horror.

60
00:06:20,505 --> 00:06:22,340
-Sorry! I'm getting off!
-That stings!

61
00:06:22,423 --> 00:06:27,345
Because romance is a genre
that can never exist in my life.

62
00:06:27,845 --> 00:06:29,430
Unlike in my scripts.

63
00:06:31,682 --> 00:06:33,351
HYE-JU STRIDES AWAY

64
00:06:34,018 --> 00:06:35,144
Ma'am!

65
00:06:35,228 --> 00:06:36,604
(WITH A BURNING GAZE)

66
00:06:41,442 --> 00:06:42,485
You got on the bus too?

67
00:06:42,568 --> 00:06:43,403
(SHARPLY)

68
00:06:43,486 --> 00:06:45,446
I told you not to escort me to work.

69
00:06:45,905 --> 00:06:46,739
(AGITATED)

70
00:06:46,823 --> 00:06:49,492
How could I not?
I'm going crazy worrying about you.

71
00:06:49,575 --> 00:06:51,911
You're a bodyguard, so act like one.

72
00:06:51,994 --> 00:06:53,162
You went too far.

73
00:06:53,246 --> 00:06:54,205
(WITH A WARNING GLARE)

74
00:06:54,789 --> 00:06:57,667
AS HYE-JU TURNS TO WALK AWAY,
I-HYEOK GRABS HER ARM

75
00:06:59,419 --> 00:07:03,589
I-HYEOK PULLS HER INTO A ROUGH KISS

76
00:07:05,633 --> 00:07:09,429
HYE-JU IS STARTLED AT FIRST,
BUT SOON MELTS INTO THE KISS

77
00:07:18,062 --> 00:07:20,606
Did you put honey on your lips?

78
00:07:20,690 --> 00:07:21,774
(BREATHLESSLY)

79
00:07:21,858 --> 00:07:22,733
They taste so sweet.

80
00:07:22,817 --> 00:07:24,026
Your lips taste even sweeter.

81
00:07:24,110 --> 00:07:24,944
(POUTING)

82
00:07:27,113 --> 00:07:28,489
Ms. Na, are you crazy?

83
00:07:32,994 --> 00:07:33,828
What's wrong?

84
00:07:33,911 --> 00:07:36,539
It was going so well.
Why fumble the kiss every time?

85
00:07:36,622 --> 00:07:39,041
"Honey on your lips"?
What do we do with this?

86
00:07:39,125 --> 00:07:41,669
What are they, bears?
Why would they taste like honey?

87
00:07:41,752 --> 00:07:44,714
What kind of bodyguard kisses
their chaebol employer like that?

88
00:07:44,797 --> 00:07:45,965
Isn't it bold and sexy?

89
00:07:46,048 --> 00:07:48,176
It works in words, yeah.

90
00:07:48,259 --> 00:07:51,220
But I'm at a total loss
for words, seriously!

91
00:07:51,304 --> 00:07:55,266
Anyway, the male lead has only been
her bodyguard for two weeks.

92
00:07:55,349 --> 00:07:58,811
Why is he suddenly head over heels
and grabbing her for a kiss?

93
00:07:58,895 --> 00:08:01,647
Isn't that what happens
when you fall in love?

94
00:08:01,731 --> 00:08:03,691
Like, you lose sight of everything else.

95
00:08:03,774 --> 00:08:07,528
All you want is to be with this person.
You hear bells ringing, and--

96
00:08:07,612 --> 00:08:08,613
Ms. Na.

97
00:08:09,197 --> 00:08:10,531
Be honest with me.

98
00:08:11,949 --> 00:08:13,326
You've never dated, have you?

99
00:08:13,951 --> 00:08:16,204
My goodness.

100
00:08:16,287 --> 00:08:18,289
I'm almost 30 now.

101
00:08:18,372 --> 00:08:20,625
"Never dated"? Please. That's ridiculous.

102
00:08:20,708 --> 00:08:23,252
Yeah? So you've dated someone?

103
00:08:23,336 --> 00:08:26,005
Kisses, walks along the Hangang River,
theme park dates…

104
00:08:26,088 --> 00:08:27,298
You've done all that?

105
00:08:27,381 --> 00:08:28,966
Of course I've… done it all.

106
00:08:29,550 --> 00:08:31,594
Are you kidding?
That's like the bare minimum.

107
00:08:31,677 --> 00:08:35,056
Guys were lining up for me
back in the day.

108
00:08:35,139 --> 00:08:36,891
Oh, really?

109
00:08:36,974 --> 00:08:38,518
So what happened to your game?

110
00:08:38,601 --> 00:08:40,269
Just look at your male lead.

111
00:08:40,353 --> 00:08:42,647
The way you write it,
romance might as well be dead.

112
00:08:42,730 --> 00:08:44,398
In fact, the coffin's nailed shut.

113
00:08:44,482 --> 00:08:45,942
Of course it is.

114
00:08:46,025 --> 00:08:49,695
I've never dated.
I'd run if a guy tried to hold my hand.

115
00:08:49,779 --> 00:08:51,781
Honestly, everything else is fine.

116
00:08:51,864 --> 00:08:52,698
When you debuted,

117
00:08:52,782 --> 00:08:56,077
I couldn't stop praising you
and telling everyone I had dibs on you.

118
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:58,788
Great dialogue, great story.
The characters have depth.

119
00:08:58,871 --> 00:09:02,166
So why do the characters always
go off the rails when romance hits?

120
00:09:02,250 --> 00:09:04,168
Why must you let the viewers down?

121
00:09:04,252 --> 00:09:06,254
Why stab them in the back? Why?

122
00:09:06,337 --> 00:09:09,006
It's not like I do it on purpose.

123
00:09:09,507 --> 00:09:11,634
Our contract ends in three months.

124
00:09:11,717 --> 00:09:13,928
You do want to renew it, Ms. Na.

125
00:09:14,011 --> 00:09:14,971
Don't you?

126
00:09:15,471 --> 00:09:16,305
I do.

127
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:19,016
Three months.

128
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:23,854
I'll give you three months
to come up with a sexy romance.

129
00:09:24,981 --> 00:09:27,817
Grab someone off the street
and date them if you have to.

130
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:30,528
A steamy, mature romance.

131
00:09:31,404 --> 00:09:32,613
That's what I want.

132
00:09:34,156 --> 00:09:34,991
Yes, sir.

133
00:09:39,954 --> 00:09:42,582
TS RESORT, JEJU

134
00:09:43,666 --> 00:09:45,793
Oh no! This is crazy. What do we do?

135
00:09:47,837 --> 00:09:49,380
I can't breathe!

136
00:09:52,758 --> 00:09:54,343
The rain got in my mouth!

137
00:09:56,387 --> 00:09:57,930
Where are we going?

138
00:09:58,014 --> 00:09:58,848
That way.

139
00:09:58,931 --> 00:10:01,934
Please just pick up your phone! Come on!

140
00:10:33,591 --> 00:10:35,509
Yes. Have you arrived?

141
00:10:43,225 --> 00:10:44,435
You may head on up…

142
00:10:47,355 --> 00:10:48,648
and ambush them.

143
00:10:58,866 --> 00:10:59,825
TS RESORT, SEOUL

144
00:10:59,909 --> 00:11:01,786
Who's going to brief him
on the Jeju resort?

145
00:11:01,869 --> 00:11:05,581
It was the Jeju resort GM
who raised the issue. HR should handle it.

146
00:11:05,665 --> 00:11:07,208
What are you talking about?

147
00:11:07,291 --> 00:11:10,294
It's about booking cancellations.
That's the Rooms Division's job.

148
00:11:10,378 --> 00:11:11,504
Jeez.

149
00:11:12,088 --> 00:11:17,218
Man, just thinking about that young punk
smirking and nitpicking everything…

150
00:11:17,802 --> 00:11:19,011
What's that?

151
00:11:19,804 --> 00:11:20,638
Stomach medicine.

152
00:11:21,347 --> 00:11:23,349
Oh, he's here.

153
00:11:49,917 --> 00:11:51,585
Hello, sir.

154
00:11:54,839 --> 00:11:55,840
Let's go.

155
00:12:12,273 --> 00:12:14,483
Sir.

156
00:12:15,276 --> 00:12:19,363
You're aware Jeju got hit pretty hard
by a typhoon recently, aren't you?

157
00:12:19,864 --> 00:12:20,698
Yes, I am.

158
00:12:21,198 --> 00:12:26,662
It seems the resort sustained
significant damage from the typhoon.

159
00:12:27,163 --> 00:12:30,166
Thanks to your foresight, sir,
the buildings were built so well

160
00:12:30,249 --> 00:12:32,543
that the facilities suffered no damage.

161
00:12:32,626 --> 00:12:36,130
However, with the flight cancellations
and road damage,

162
00:12:36,213 --> 00:12:38,841
I'm afraid we've had
many booking cancellations.

163
00:12:39,592 --> 00:12:43,846
We are still assessing
the extent of the damage.

164
00:12:55,065 --> 00:12:58,319
This, this, and that will be
our featured dishes this season.

165
00:12:58,903 --> 00:12:59,987
Redo everything else.

166
00:13:06,786 --> 00:13:09,872
We're still calculating
the exact value of the cancellations.

167
00:13:09,955 --> 00:13:11,540
We'll update you by day's end.

168
00:13:11,624 --> 00:13:12,875
Yes, so?

169
00:13:13,375 --> 00:13:16,212
So, based on our analysis,

170
00:13:16,295 --> 00:13:21,634
we may not meet the sales target
for TS Resort's 30th anniversary--

171
00:13:21,717 --> 00:13:22,968
One of the lights is out.

172
00:13:26,055 --> 00:13:28,474
Oh, I see.
We'll have it replaced right away.

173
00:13:30,226 --> 00:13:33,521
We collected the cancellation fees,
so it isn't a total loss.

174
00:13:33,604 --> 00:13:38,400
And the guests that are on-site
have decided to extend their stays,

175
00:13:38,484 --> 00:13:40,319
so we'll collect additional charges.

176
00:13:40,402 --> 00:13:42,738
You don't need to worry about that, sir.

177
00:13:43,239 --> 00:13:44,782
-Is that so?
-Oh, yes.

178
00:13:44,865 --> 00:13:48,577
Any difficult guests who refused to pay
were required to check out.

179
00:13:53,874 --> 00:13:57,211
And who was it that made such a decision?

180
00:13:57,294 --> 00:13:59,380
It was General Manager Heo Ji-hwan.

181
00:14:01,632 --> 00:14:04,385
Right. General Manager Heo.

182
00:14:16,146 --> 00:14:17,606
-Mr. Yoon.
-Yes, sir.

183
00:14:18,107 --> 00:14:20,025
We changed the landscaping company, right?

184
00:14:20,109 --> 00:14:21,110
Yes, sir.

185
00:14:21,193 --> 00:14:24,154
Change it again.
They're all different shapes.

186
00:14:24,655 --> 00:14:25,865
Yes, sir.

187
00:14:29,535 --> 00:14:30,369
Director Jang?

188
00:14:30,452 --> 00:14:32,037
Oh, yes, sir.

189
00:14:32,121 --> 00:14:34,456
Could you call Mr. Heo?

190
00:14:34,540 --> 00:14:35,541
Sure.

191
00:14:38,961 --> 00:14:40,713
TS RESORT JEJU
GENERAL MANAGER HEO JI-HWAN

192
00:14:41,839 --> 00:14:42,798
Mr. Heo?

193
00:14:42,882 --> 00:14:45,718
Yes, sir. Have you been well?

194
00:14:45,801 --> 00:14:49,763
The Jeju resort has been in an emergency
because of the typhoon,

195
00:14:49,847 --> 00:14:51,891
and you've handled it very well.

196
00:14:51,974 --> 00:14:55,895
Mr. Baek personally asked me
to give you a call.

197
00:14:55,978 --> 00:14:57,313
Oh, it was nothing.

198
00:14:57,396 --> 00:15:02,276
As the general manager of TS Resort Jeju,
I had to take firm action.

199
00:15:02,359 --> 00:15:04,028
Please don't worry about the rest.

200
00:15:06,405 --> 00:15:07,448
Hey, Ms. Go.

201
00:15:07,531 --> 00:15:08,949
You ready?

202
00:15:09,450 --> 00:15:11,744
Yes, we're in, sir.

203
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:15,956
What's going on?

204
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:17,249
Excuse me.

205
00:15:17,333 --> 00:15:18,959
Look this way. Cheese!

206
00:15:19,043 --> 00:15:20,586
What is this? Put that away!

207
00:15:20,669 --> 00:15:22,338
Why the hell are you recording us?

208
00:15:22,421 --> 00:15:23,923
-What's this about?
-Sir.

209
00:15:24,006 --> 00:15:29,094
Just like you said, Mr. Heo
is having some kind of golf meeting

210
00:15:29,178 --> 00:15:30,554
in the canceled suite.

211
00:15:30,638 --> 00:15:31,555
Okay.

212
00:15:31,639 --> 00:15:33,390
I just sent the video to Mr. Baek.

213
00:15:33,474 --> 00:15:35,851
We've also secured photos of the scene.

214
00:15:35,935 --> 00:15:38,062
-What?
-Mr. Heo, what the hell is this?

215
00:15:38,145 --> 00:15:40,064
Where the hell did you guys come from?

216
00:15:43,692 --> 00:15:44,860
You heard that, right?

217
00:15:46,278 --> 00:15:50,783
Mr. Heo has been using canceled suites

218
00:15:50,866 --> 00:15:54,244
for personal use, free of charge.

219
00:15:54,828 --> 00:15:56,664
-Has he lost his mind?
-You didn't know?

220
00:15:56,747 --> 00:15:57,831
You can't be serious.

221
00:15:57,915 --> 00:16:00,417
Fire Mr. Heo immediately
and press charges.

222
00:16:00,501 --> 00:16:01,418
Yes, sir.

223
00:16:02,211 --> 00:16:03,796
Have the secretarial team apologize

224
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:05,923
to the guests
who were forced to check out.

225
00:16:06,715 --> 00:16:07,967
I'll handle it right away.

226
00:16:08,050 --> 00:16:11,470
And open up all the available rooms
at the Jeju resort

227
00:16:11,553 --> 00:16:14,306
to the victims of the typhoon,

228
00:16:14,390 --> 00:16:16,558
free of charge.

229
00:16:16,642 --> 00:16:17,851
-Pardon?
-Sorry?

230
00:16:18,519 --> 00:16:19,979
But that's…

231
00:16:21,855 --> 00:16:22,690
Oh.

232
00:16:25,776 --> 00:16:30,698
You said we might not hit our sales target
for our 30th anniversary, right?

233
00:16:32,616 --> 00:16:33,575
I think

234
00:16:34,159 --> 00:16:35,703
we can pull it off.

235
00:16:49,341 --> 00:16:51,218
WISHING YOU A SWIFT RETURN TO NORMAL

236
00:17:01,395 --> 00:17:02,771
No regular reservations.

237
00:17:02,855 --> 00:17:05,691
We're only taking in
the victims of the typhoon.

238
00:17:06,233 --> 00:17:07,818
You'll have to use the stairs.

239
00:17:07,901 --> 00:17:11,864
Yes, the lobby is full.
Please direct them to the conference hall.

240
00:17:11,947 --> 00:17:15,701
TS Resort Jeju has decided to open

241
00:17:15,784 --> 00:17:18,245
the entire resort to typhoon victims,

242
00:17:18,328 --> 00:17:20,330
free of charge.

243
00:17:20,414 --> 00:17:22,583
Baek Ho-rang,
Senior Managing Director of TS Resort,

244
00:17:22,666 --> 00:17:27,755
is converting the rooms and lobby
at TS Resort Jeju into emergency shelters

245
00:17:27,838 --> 00:17:30,299
and plans to join the recovery efforts.

246
00:17:31,633 --> 00:17:32,968
What about the Jeju resort?

247
00:17:33,469 --> 00:17:36,722
Families with vulnerable members
were assigned to suites.

248
00:17:36,805 --> 00:17:39,308
Private houses
were assigned by family or individual,

249
00:17:39,391 --> 00:17:41,185
with individuals separated by gender.

250
00:17:41,268 --> 00:17:42,102
And the support?

251
00:17:42,186 --> 00:17:44,772
As requested,
all victims will stay free for a month.

252
00:17:44,855 --> 00:17:46,857
We've sent supplies to the disaster area

253
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:49,777
and will be making a donation
through Jeju City Hall.

254
00:17:50,277 --> 00:17:53,822
The media is praising TS Resort's
sense of social responsibility.

255
00:17:54,323 --> 00:17:56,700
Public sentiment is positive,
and the stock is up.

256
00:17:58,368 --> 00:18:01,747
Then it's time to find our new face.

257
00:18:01,830 --> 00:18:03,207
Have you started looking?

258
00:18:04,249 --> 00:18:05,250
The thing is…

259
00:18:08,295 --> 00:18:10,297
Actor Ji Eun-ho is our first choice.

260
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:12,591
No. 1 in brand reputation and buzz
for months.

261
00:18:12,674 --> 00:18:14,510
Dramas, movies, variety shows…

262
00:18:14,593 --> 00:18:17,471
His idol-level popularity
means he's flooded with offers.

263
00:18:17,554 --> 00:18:19,264
JI EUN-HO BRINGS AIRPORT TO A STANDSTILL

264
00:18:23,227 --> 00:18:24,770
WHEN THE SCHOOL BELL RINGS

265
00:18:29,942 --> 00:18:31,360
FOLLOWERS

266
00:18:31,777 --> 00:18:33,695
JI EUN-HO
"WORLDWIDE FAME FEELS UNREAL"

267
00:18:33,779 --> 00:18:35,948
JI EUN-HO EMERGES AS A GLOBAL STAR

268
00:18:38,033 --> 00:18:41,662
He recently won Best Actor
at the Heuksang Arts Awards.

269
00:18:41,745 --> 00:18:44,623
His drama was a massive hit,
so he has fans worldwide.

270
00:18:44,706 --> 00:18:47,167
He's even received
an offer from Hollywood recently.

271
00:18:49,128 --> 00:18:50,963
Not bad. So?

272
00:18:52,339 --> 00:18:55,509
So, for the reasons I just mentioned…

273
00:18:57,886 --> 00:18:59,930
we can't reach him, let alone sign him.

274
00:19:02,015 --> 00:19:02,975
Mr. Yoon.

275
00:19:04,059 --> 00:19:05,060
Are you kidding me?

276
00:19:06,895 --> 00:19:08,272
Gosh, this is so stressful.

277
00:19:08,981 --> 00:19:11,942
I've already got enough headaches
dealing with the Jeju resort

278
00:19:12,025 --> 00:19:13,652
and figuring out a plan,

279
00:19:13,735 --> 00:19:14,736
and now you?

280
00:19:17,114 --> 00:19:19,992
I told you to sign him,
but you can't even reach him?

281
00:19:20,075 --> 00:19:22,578
You call that a report?
Am I the only one working here?

282
00:19:22,661 --> 00:19:23,996
Right now, I…

283
00:19:24,788 --> 00:19:25,789
Sir.

284
00:19:27,124 --> 00:19:27,958
Sir.

285
00:19:29,543 --> 00:19:31,128
You scared me.

286
00:19:31,628 --> 00:19:33,338
I have a weak heart, you know.

287
00:19:33,422 --> 00:19:34,840
Please calm down.

288
00:19:34,923 --> 00:19:36,300
Take a deep breath.

289
00:19:38,468 --> 00:19:41,388
Your heart rate is over 100 right now.

290
00:19:43,223 --> 00:19:45,559
It goes over
whenever I try to do anything.

291
00:19:45,642 --> 00:19:47,728
Deep breath.

292
00:19:52,649 --> 00:19:57,487
Clear your mind
of distracting thoughts and worries.

293
00:20:00,407 --> 00:20:01,533
Let go

294
00:20:02,034 --> 00:20:05,329
of the urge to control

295
00:20:06,747 --> 00:20:08,040
everything.

296
00:20:21,845 --> 00:20:23,055
Where is Ji Eun-ho?

297
00:20:23,931 --> 00:20:24,765
Pardon?

298
00:20:24,848 --> 00:20:27,684
I'll sign him myself.

299
00:20:39,696 --> 00:20:42,741
-Na… Bo-bae.
-Hey, Seo-jeong.

300
00:20:53,085 --> 00:20:54,795
Looks like you got chewed out again.

301
00:20:54,878 --> 00:20:57,172
What was it this time?
Romance? Physical affection?

302
00:20:57,256 --> 00:20:59,216
-The kiss scene.
-Oh boy.

303
00:21:00,133 --> 00:21:02,594
What does Director Yeom expect
from someone who's never dated?

304
00:21:02,678 --> 00:21:05,055
Quiet. Someone might hear you.

305
00:21:10,519 --> 00:21:11,645
Damn it.

306
00:21:11,728 --> 00:21:13,397
It's doing it again.

307
00:21:18,068 --> 00:21:20,612
What the… This isn't working either?

308
00:21:20,696 --> 00:21:23,824
Damn it. What's going on?
Why isn't anything working?

309
00:21:23,907 --> 00:21:26,660
I know. Nothing's working.

310
00:21:26,743 --> 00:21:27,828
Nothing at all.

311
00:21:29,371 --> 00:21:30,372
What?

312
00:21:30,455 --> 00:21:32,249
-Bo-bae.
-No. I don't want to.

313
00:21:32,332 --> 00:21:33,750
I don't wanna do it in public.

314
00:21:33,834 --> 00:21:35,752
It's just us here. What's the big deal?

315
00:21:36,336 --> 00:21:37,838
There are cameras.

316
00:21:38,463 --> 00:21:40,757
-No, stop.
-Oh, come on. Please.

317
00:21:40,841 --> 00:21:43,093
Director Yeom will lose it
if I don't hurry.

318
00:21:43,176 --> 00:21:44,886
Help out your friend here. Please.

319
00:21:48,557 --> 00:21:52,728
If you help me, I'll tell you
about this guy I met recently.

320
00:21:52,811 --> 00:21:55,939
I'll tell you everything,
right down to the kiss.

321
00:21:59,067 --> 00:22:00,736
Damn it.

322
00:22:27,554 --> 00:22:28,388
Whoa.

323
00:22:29,014 --> 00:22:29,848
Damn.

324
00:22:29,931 --> 00:22:32,017
As expected of the human Pikachu.

325
00:22:32,601 --> 00:22:34,102
I told you not to call me that.

326
00:22:34,186 --> 00:22:36,146
I'm really sorry.

327
00:22:36,229 --> 00:22:37,773
But thanks a lot, Bo-bae.

328
00:22:38,732 --> 00:22:39,733
Love ya.

329
00:22:42,736 --> 00:22:43,779
The truth is,

330
00:22:44,279 --> 00:22:46,948
I have a secret
that I can never tell anyone.

331
00:22:53,830 --> 00:22:56,375
-What should we eat?
-Well, I want sundae.

332
00:22:56,458 --> 00:22:57,584
I want tteokbokki.

333
00:22:57,667 --> 00:22:58,835
Then I'll have two bowls.

334
00:22:59,419 --> 00:23:00,796
Then I'll have three bowls.

335
00:23:00,879 --> 00:23:02,214
Then I'll have four bowls.

336
00:23:35,831 --> 00:23:37,290
After lightning struck me,

337
00:23:37,374 --> 00:23:39,584
I suddenly gained electrical powers.

338
00:23:55,767 --> 00:23:56,726
Bo-bae.

339
00:23:57,894 --> 00:23:59,187
When you're outside,

340
00:24:00,021 --> 00:24:02,315
you must never touch anyone.

341
00:24:04,818 --> 00:24:06,987
Electricity started to flow
through my body.

342
00:24:23,920 --> 00:24:24,838
A cockroach!

343
00:24:24,921 --> 00:24:26,715
-Ji-hye!
-What's wrong? What happened?

344
00:24:26,798 --> 00:24:28,550
A cockroach!

345
00:24:28,633 --> 00:24:30,594
Ji-hye, hurry up and catch it.

346
00:24:31,428 --> 00:24:32,262
Ji-hye!

347
00:24:32,345 --> 00:24:35,682
The more emotional I became,
the stronger my electrical powers grew.

348
00:24:41,688 --> 00:24:42,689
Bo-bae.

349
00:24:42,772 --> 00:24:45,901
You said you liked me.
You said you wanted to go out with me.

350
00:24:45,984 --> 00:24:48,278
But you guys aren't even official yet.

351
00:24:48,361 --> 00:24:51,781
I heard you even told him
not to hold your hand or touch you at all.

352
00:24:53,492 --> 00:24:55,160
You even told her things like that?

353
00:24:55,243 --> 00:24:56,328
Well, it's true.

354
00:24:56,953 --> 00:25:00,123
You left me hanging
and wouldn't let me touch you.

355
00:25:00,207 --> 00:25:01,791
Who would want to date you?

356
00:25:41,164 --> 00:25:43,583
I ended up completely alone

357
00:25:45,085 --> 00:25:46,836
thanks to this damn power of mine.

358
00:25:57,514 --> 00:25:58,974
You can smile, right?

359
00:25:59,975 --> 00:26:01,977
Whoa. Why are there so many people?

360
00:26:02,561 --> 00:26:05,230
Hey, I think a celebrity's coming.
Put your gloves on.

361
00:26:05,313 --> 00:26:06,648
I'm off.

362
00:26:07,148 --> 00:26:09,901
I'll call you after work.
I've got a kiss story for you.

363
00:26:12,362 --> 00:26:14,239
Thanks, you rascal.

364
00:26:25,458 --> 00:26:27,335
Seriously, what's wrong with me?

365
00:26:55,947 --> 00:26:59,534
Was my visit here leaked to the reporters?

366
00:27:00,035 --> 00:27:01,328
I don't think so.

367
00:27:02,078 --> 00:27:03,204
They aren't reporters.

368
00:27:12,881 --> 00:27:13,715
Let's go.

369
00:27:28,229 --> 00:27:30,231
Look, it's Eun-ho!

370
00:27:30,315 --> 00:27:31,650
-I think it's over!
-Let's go!

371
00:27:33,652 --> 00:27:37,447
Sir.

372
00:27:37,530 --> 00:27:39,115
Hey.

373
00:27:41,368 --> 00:27:42,285
Sir!

374
00:27:42,786 --> 00:27:44,371
Sir!

375
00:27:46,581 --> 00:27:47,415
Sir.

376
00:27:56,883 --> 00:27:58,677
Thank you.

377
00:28:00,011 --> 00:28:01,262
Sir!

378
00:28:02,305 --> 00:28:04,307
Thank you.

379
00:28:50,353 --> 00:28:51,396
That was…

380
00:28:51,980 --> 00:28:53,356
Well…

381
00:28:55,024 --> 00:28:55,859
Are you okay?

382
00:28:55,942 --> 00:28:57,569
Oh, yes.

383
00:29:00,363 --> 00:29:01,990
As you just saw, I got pushed.

384
00:29:02,657 --> 00:29:03,992
I know it was an accident.

385
00:29:04,784 --> 00:29:05,952
Sorry about that.

386
00:29:06,035 --> 00:29:07,036
Not at all.

387
00:29:15,587 --> 00:29:16,921
Huh?

388
00:29:19,090 --> 00:29:20,216
Sir!

389
00:29:20,300 --> 00:29:21,843
Excuse me.

390
00:29:26,139 --> 00:29:27,474
Wait! Hold on!

391
00:29:28,183 --> 00:29:29,392
Wait.

392
00:29:32,145 --> 00:29:34,856
Excuse me for a moment.

393
00:29:44,866 --> 00:29:46,743
Nothing's flowing. For real.

394
00:29:46,826 --> 00:29:48,244
What are you doing?

395
00:29:48,828 --> 00:29:49,662
Earlier…

396
00:29:50,455 --> 00:29:53,333
When our lips touched earlier,

397
00:29:53,416 --> 00:29:55,752
did you feel anything?

398
00:29:55,835 --> 00:29:58,004
Like a tingle? Or perhaps a spark?

399
00:30:00,632 --> 00:30:03,218
No, I felt nothing at all.

400
00:30:03,802 --> 00:30:04,636
If you'll excuse me…

401
00:30:06,721 --> 00:30:09,224
Wait. Please excuse me.

402
00:30:09,808 --> 00:30:10,767
What are you doing?

403
00:30:10,850 --> 00:30:12,310
-Just a sec…
-What are you doing?

404
00:30:13,269 --> 00:30:15,188
-Hold on.
-What's wrong with you?

405
00:30:15,271 --> 00:30:16,731
-Please, just once.
-Hey.

406
00:30:16,815 --> 00:30:18,066
-What's with you?
-Just once.

407
00:30:22,195 --> 00:30:23,363
Just once.

408
00:30:26,658 --> 00:30:28,493
Mr. Yoon!

409
00:30:28,576 --> 00:30:30,328
Sir.

410
00:30:40,255 --> 00:30:41,339
Still nothing.

411
00:30:41,422 --> 00:30:45,176
Could this guy be immune
to my electricity?

412
00:30:45,260 --> 00:30:48,680
Like a human rubber glove?

413
00:30:51,391 --> 00:30:52,433
Excuse me.

414
00:30:53,268 --> 00:30:54,185
What is it?

415
00:30:55,061 --> 00:30:56,187
By any chance,

416
00:30:56,688 --> 00:30:59,357
could we try just one more time…

417
00:30:59,440 --> 00:31:00,441
Sir!

418
00:31:04,112 --> 00:31:05,697
Are you all right?

419
00:31:10,034 --> 00:31:10,869
Do you know her?

420
00:31:10,952 --> 00:31:13,162
No, I don't know her.

421
00:31:13,872 --> 00:31:16,040
I'm not interested in you, so please stop.

422
00:31:16,624 --> 00:31:18,167
No, that's not it.

423
00:31:19,544 --> 00:31:21,588
Can we talk for a second?

424
00:31:22,088 --> 00:31:24,299
Just one moment. Can we please…

425
00:31:24,382 --> 00:31:27,260
Wait. Can we talk for a second?
I'll be super quick.

426
00:31:28,052 --> 00:31:30,513
-If you lay a finger on him…
-No, I…

427
00:31:31,681 --> 00:31:33,433
I'm so sorry!

428
00:31:35,059 --> 00:31:37,270
So why didn't anything happen to him?

429
00:31:43,484 --> 00:31:44,485
What's wrong?

430
00:31:46,821 --> 00:31:48,156
-What's wrong?
-My stomach…

431
00:31:48,239 --> 00:31:49,115
Sorry!

432
00:31:50,909 --> 00:31:53,119
My stomach hurts!

433
00:31:55,914 --> 00:32:01,169
I'm sorry,
but I really need to see that man again.

434
00:32:01,252 --> 00:32:03,338
My human rubber glove.

435
00:32:03,922 --> 00:32:04,756
Does this hurt?

436
00:32:05,965 --> 00:32:07,592
We'll get you to the hospital.

437
00:32:09,385 --> 00:32:10,637
No!

438
00:32:16,809 --> 00:32:18,561
Whoa, I wonder what happened.

439
00:32:19,646 --> 00:32:21,314
The person they just took away.

440
00:32:22,565 --> 00:32:24,025
Didn't she look like Bo-bae?

441
00:32:24,108 --> 00:32:25,568
You mean, the writer?

442
00:32:26,069 --> 00:32:27,487
Why would she be here?

443
00:32:27,987 --> 00:32:32,158
Well, maybe she had a meeting here today.

444
00:32:33,451 --> 00:32:34,452
Let me call her.

445
00:32:34,535 --> 00:32:38,122
Eun-ho, you're making me nervous.
Today's meeting is really important, okay?

446
00:32:38,206 --> 00:32:39,040
Yeah, I know.

447
00:32:39,123 --> 00:32:41,668
If you disappear on me, I'm dead.

448
00:32:41,751 --> 00:32:43,628
Call her after the meeting, okay?

449
00:32:43,711 --> 00:32:45,546
-Damn it. This keeps falling.
-No answer.

450
00:32:46,381 --> 00:32:48,675
-I have a bad feeling about this.
-Hey.

451
00:32:48,758 --> 00:32:49,926
Hey, Ji Eun-ho!

452
00:32:50,009 --> 00:32:51,010
Oh man.

453
00:32:51,094 --> 00:32:54,013
Eun-ho, where are you going?
The director is waiting!

454
00:33:07,860 --> 00:33:10,780
Did something happen to Eun-ho?
He's usually not like this.

455
00:33:10,863 --> 00:33:14,909
Didn't you say you could get me a meeting
with Ji Eun-ho anytime I wanted?

456
00:33:14,993 --> 00:33:16,661
He's nowhere in sight,

457
00:33:17,996 --> 00:33:20,915
and I've been on a date with you
for the past 30 minutes.

458
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:22,834
You're right.

459
00:33:23,584 --> 00:33:26,963
The time I'm spending with you
is just as precious and meaningful to me.

460
00:33:27,046 --> 00:33:28,214
-Mr. Yoon.
-Ho-rang.

461
00:33:28,297 --> 00:33:30,717
I mean, Mr. Baek! Please wait.

462
00:33:31,676 --> 00:33:34,178
I'll do whatever it takes
to set up another meeting.

463
00:33:34,262 --> 00:33:37,515
In return, could you put in a good word
for me at TS Resort?

464
00:33:37,598 --> 00:33:40,393
They let us shoot there,
but half the place was off-limits.

465
00:33:41,936 --> 00:33:44,272
Did your proposal include
any backup plans?

466
00:33:44,355 --> 00:33:45,440
Backup plans?

467
00:33:45,523 --> 00:33:48,860
Come up with an efficient shooting plan
and include Plans B and C.

468
00:33:48,943 --> 00:33:50,278
They'll probably approve it.

469
00:33:50,361 --> 00:33:52,405
Come on, Ho-rang. I'm your college senior.

470
00:33:52,488 --> 00:33:54,157
Look, I'm on my knees.

471
00:33:54,240 --> 00:33:57,577
If I still had to submit paperwork,
I wouldn't have asked you.

472
00:33:57,660 --> 00:34:02,248
Meeting Ji Eun-ho
was my condition for helping you.

473
00:34:02,331 --> 00:34:05,126
But Ji Eun-ho isn't here, is he?

474
00:34:07,712 --> 00:34:08,755
Hey, Ho-rang.

475
00:34:11,382 --> 00:34:12,884
That heartless bastard.

476
00:34:12,967 --> 00:34:14,052
Plan?

477
00:34:14,135 --> 00:34:15,553
Plan A, B, C, D, E, F, G!

478
00:34:15,636 --> 00:34:17,597
Why not go all the way to Z?

479
00:34:17,680 --> 00:34:19,807
You and your damn plans.

480
00:34:50,838 --> 00:34:53,925
Pay up if you wanna film me,
you fucking bastards!

481
00:34:54,008 --> 00:34:56,469
"TS Hotel's Choi Do-yoon."

482
00:34:56,552 --> 00:35:00,223
"Drunk at club,
shouting, 'You f***ing bastards.'"

483
00:35:00,890 --> 00:35:01,724
What a sight.

484
00:35:02,642 --> 00:35:06,145
"TS Hotel's reputation
has taken a serious hit."

485
00:35:06,229 --> 00:35:11,776
"The incident caused TS Hotel to drop out
of this year's major hotel rankings,

486
00:35:11,859 --> 00:35:13,820
while its subsidiary, TS Resort, also fell

487
00:35:13,903 --> 00:35:16,739
in the domestic hotel
and resort sales rankings."

488
00:35:20,910 --> 00:35:24,413
I build up the company with the resort,
and he sinks it with the hotel.

489
00:35:24,497 --> 00:35:26,916
What is this, a seesaw?

490
00:35:46,269 --> 00:35:48,187
Find out where Ji Eun-ho is.

491
00:35:48,271 --> 00:35:49,689
I need to see him in person.

492
00:35:49,772 --> 00:35:50,898
You mean today?

493
00:35:50,982 --> 00:35:53,818
Sir, you should head to the hospital
after this temple visit.

494
00:35:53,901 --> 00:35:57,363
Our Plan A was for you to sign Ji Eun-ho,
but you failed.

495
00:35:57,446 --> 00:36:00,283
Then Plan B.
We should've convinced Ji Eun-ho today.

496
00:36:00,366 --> 00:36:02,952
But that fell through too.
Where do we go from here?

497
00:36:03,035 --> 00:36:04,203
We go with Plan C.

498
00:36:04,287 --> 00:36:07,498
Plan C is for me to go see him myself
if he doesn't show up.

499
00:36:07,582 --> 00:36:10,084
It has to be today.
That's why my surgery's tomorrow.

500
00:36:10,168 --> 00:36:11,711
-Still--
-And Plan D?

501
00:36:11,794 --> 00:36:15,548
If we don't meet Ji Eun-ho today,
we'll postpone my surgery.

502
00:36:15,631 --> 00:36:17,592
Yes, understood.

503
00:36:18,426 --> 00:36:19,719
I'll find him no matter what.

504
00:36:19,802 --> 00:36:21,888
Contact a suitable ad agency as well.

505
00:36:22,680 --> 00:36:23,598
But first,

506
00:36:24,599 --> 00:36:26,225
go say hello to your sister.

507
00:36:56,172 --> 00:36:57,340
You're here.

508
00:36:57,924 --> 00:36:59,842
Did you come to see your mom and dad?

509
00:37:00,468 --> 00:37:01,302
Yes.

510
00:37:01,385 --> 00:37:05,556
I thought they'd be happy to hear
this will be my last surgery.

511
00:37:09,101 --> 00:37:11,187
BAEK GYEONG-SEOK
RYU MIN-SEON

512
00:37:11,896 --> 00:37:13,898
You saw what Do-yoon did, right?

513
00:37:14,398 --> 00:37:16,609
That brat is a lost cause.

514
00:37:18,277 --> 00:37:20,655
After this surgery,
you'll be normal again, right?

515
00:37:20,738 --> 00:37:22,573
I'm already normal as I am.

516
00:37:22,657 --> 00:37:25,201
Make sure you come back healthy this time.

517
00:37:25,284 --> 00:37:28,663
Any sign of weakness
will complicate the succession.

518
00:37:29,288 --> 00:37:33,167
You need to become a leader like
your parents, flawless in the public eye.

519
00:37:48,849 --> 00:37:50,351
Ma'am.

520
00:37:51,811 --> 00:37:52,812
Ma'am!

521
00:37:53,312 --> 00:37:54,647
Ms. Baek.

522
00:37:54,730 --> 00:37:55,564
What is it?

523
00:37:56,065 --> 00:37:57,525
Mr. Baek isn't in today.

524
00:37:57,608 --> 00:37:59,068
Where did he go?

525
00:37:59,151 --> 00:38:02,530
We can't disclose his schedule,
not even to his family.

526
00:38:02,613 --> 00:38:03,531
I'm sorry.

527
00:38:03,614 --> 00:38:04,490
Excuse me?

528
00:38:04,573 --> 00:38:07,159
Does it look like I'm here
as Baek Ho-rang's family?

529
00:38:07,243 --> 00:38:09,537
I'm here as the CEO of TS Hotel!

530
00:38:09,620 --> 00:38:11,414
Isn't my name on his schedule today?

531
00:38:12,331 --> 00:38:13,165
I'm sorry.

532
00:38:13,249 --> 00:38:14,875
I don't want your apology!

533
00:38:14,959 --> 00:38:16,544
My schedule.

534
00:38:16,627 --> 00:38:18,629
Check, please!

535
00:38:18,713 --> 00:38:21,090
-Mom, come on.
-Seriously.

536
00:38:21,173 --> 00:38:24,051
You shouldn't yell
at such a beautiful young lady.

537
00:38:24,135 --> 00:38:26,387
She startled you, didn't she? Sorry.

538
00:38:26,470 --> 00:38:28,764
My mom's going through menopause
these days.

539
00:38:32,101 --> 00:38:33,102
So?

540
00:38:34,603 --> 00:38:36,897
Where's my one and only cousin?

541
00:38:38,357 --> 00:38:39,400
Got it.

542
00:38:40,026 --> 00:38:41,402
I'll call you right away.

543
00:38:42,778 --> 00:38:44,572
Yes, understood.

544
00:38:49,160 --> 00:38:50,077
Sir.

545
00:38:51,287 --> 00:38:53,372
Ms. Baek and Director Choi Do-yoon

546
00:38:53,456 --> 00:38:55,041
are at your office now.

547
00:38:57,043 --> 00:38:59,420
Of all days,
they had to come see me today.

548
00:39:00,171 --> 00:39:02,006
Typical of my aunt and cousin.

549
00:39:03,591 --> 00:39:06,427
Anyway, did you say hello to your sister?

550
00:39:06,510 --> 00:39:10,681
Yes. Thank you for being so considerate.
I finally got to see her again.

551
00:39:12,600 --> 00:39:15,561
And I managed to find Mr. Ji Eun-ho.

552
00:39:15,644 --> 00:39:17,438
He's at Taesung Hospital right now.

553
00:39:17,521 --> 00:39:18,397
Taesung Hospital?

554
00:39:18,481 --> 00:39:20,816
He's not sick.
It looks like he's visiting someone.

555
00:39:20,900 --> 00:39:21,942
After we meet him…

556
00:39:26,655 --> 00:39:28,324
we can see Professor Jang.

557
00:39:29,325 --> 00:39:30,409
That's great.

558
00:39:41,379 --> 00:39:42,505
Still nothing.

559
00:39:45,966 --> 00:39:47,802
We've got the hottest star with us.

560
00:39:47,885 --> 00:39:50,429
-Oh my, it's Ji Eun-ho.
-Please welcome Ji Eun-ho.

561
00:39:50,513 --> 00:39:53,099
He looks just like my grandson.

562
00:39:53,182 --> 00:39:54,141
Come on.

563
00:39:54,225 --> 00:39:57,645
I bet the only thing they have in common
is that they're both human.

564
00:39:57,728 --> 00:39:59,772
I'm serious, they really look alike.

565
00:39:59,855 --> 00:40:01,315
Goodness. You always say that.

566
00:40:01,399 --> 00:40:02,233
ACTOR JI EUN-HO

567
00:40:02,316 --> 00:40:03,567
-Nice to meet you.
-Likewise.

568
00:40:03,651 --> 00:40:04,568
WE FINALLY MEET HIM

569
00:40:04,652 --> 00:40:06,612
I was wondering
when I'd see you in person.

570
00:40:06,695 --> 00:40:10,741
I love your shows, Jaejae,
so I've been wanting to meet you.

571
00:40:10,825 --> 00:40:13,786
-I'm truly honored to be here.
-Oh my.

572
00:40:13,869 --> 00:40:15,871
As expected of the king of romance.

573
00:40:15,955 --> 00:40:17,540
You've got a way with words.

574
00:40:17,623 --> 00:40:18,999
WHAT A GUY!
SWEETNESS OVERLOAD!

575
00:40:19,083 --> 00:40:22,753
So, Eun-ho,
you're known as the king of romance,

576
00:40:22,837 --> 00:40:25,798
but you debuted in a youth drama.

577
00:40:25,881 --> 00:40:26,715
Oh, yes.

578
00:40:26,799 --> 00:40:30,469
Right. You made your debut
in the one-episode drama Wistful Youth.

579
00:40:30,553 --> 00:40:34,348
And you said
it's still your favorite work.

580
00:40:34,432 --> 00:40:35,349
That's right.

581
00:40:35,433 --> 00:40:39,478
I binge-watched everything you've been in
when I heard you were coming on.

582
00:40:39,562 --> 00:40:42,815
And wow, that one was a masterpiece.
I cried my eyes out for real.

583
00:40:42,898 --> 00:40:45,067
Wow, thank you.

584
00:40:45,151 --> 00:40:50,072
That project was where
my acting career truly began.

585
00:40:50,656 --> 00:40:52,366
Ms. Writer, are you watching?

586
00:40:53,117 --> 00:40:55,202
THIS ONE'S JUST FOR YOU

587
00:40:55,828 --> 00:40:57,371
What's with him?

588
00:40:58,205 --> 00:40:59,039
Bo-bae.

589
00:40:59,123 --> 00:41:01,834
You don't hold back, do you?

590
00:41:01,917 --> 00:41:03,002
You…

591
00:41:03,085 --> 00:41:04,837
Eun-ho. Hey.

592
00:41:06,922 --> 00:41:08,132
He's tall, like a model.

593
00:41:08,215 --> 00:41:10,009
How did you know I was here?

594
00:41:12,094 --> 00:41:13,804
I know everything about you.

595
00:41:14,763 --> 00:41:17,975
All those all-nighters and takeout.
No wonder you ended up here.

596
00:41:18,058 --> 00:41:20,102
That's not why I'm sick.

597
00:41:20,186 --> 00:41:21,562
It's just that my appendix…

598
00:41:21,645 --> 00:41:23,022
Your appendix? Did it burst?

599
00:41:23,105 --> 00:41:24,315
Yeah.

600
00:41:24,398 --> 00:41:26,400
Then don't you need surgery right away?

601
00:41:26,484 --> 00:41:28,903
-I'll go get the doctor.
-Eun-ho, wait.

602
00:41:36,827 --> 00:41:38,204
-Excuse me.
-Yes?

603
00:41:39,288 --> 00:41:40,122
Ji Eun…

604
00:41:40,206 --> 00:41:41,332
You're Ji Eun-ho, right?

605
00:41:42,041 --> 00:41:45,002
There's a patient here named Na Bo-bae.

606
00:41:45,085 --> 00:41:46,253
Oh, Na Bo-bae…

607
00:41:46,337 --> 00:41:47,296
Yes.

608
00:41:51,217 --> 00:41:52,384
Mr. Ji Eun-ho?

609
00:41:59,183 --> 00:42:00,601
SENIOR MANAGING DIRECTOR
BAEK HO-RANG

610
00:42:00,684 --> 00:42:03,729
So Director Yeom set up that meeting
for you to meet me?

611
00:42:03,812 --> 00:42:04,813
Yes.

612
00:42:04,897 --> 00:42:07,983
I asked him not to tell you.
I didn't want to put you on the spot.

613
00:42:08,067 --> 00:42:12,613
Sorry I couldn't make it today.
A friend of mine suddenly got sick.

614
00:42:12,696 --> 00:42:13,864
I should head back now.

615
00:42:15,241 --> 00:42:16,492
Don't worry.

616
00:42:16,992 --> 00:42:18,786
This hospital is part of TS Group.

617
00:42:18,869 --> 00:42:23,499
If you tell me the patient's name,
I'll make sure they're well taken care of.

618
00:42:23,582 --> 00:42:25,000
Have them moved to a VIP room.

619
00:42:26,585 --> 00:42:27,545
In return,

620
00:42:27,628 --> 00:42:30,047
I'd like you to make some time for me.

621
00:42:30,130 --> 00:42:31,340
Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

622
00:42:31,423 --> 00:42:33,884
Please direct all work-related matters
to my agency.

623
00:42:36,971 --> 00:42:40,683
We're willing to accommodate
all your requests.

624
00:42:42,726 --> 00:42:43,561
Well, you see--

625
00:42:43,644 --> 00:42:45,896
Please send the patient's name
and date of birth

626
00:42:45,980 --> 00:42:48,023
to the number on my business card.

627
00:42:48,607 --> 00:42:51,610
You'll see what it's like

628
00:42:52,111 --> 00:42:54,363
to work with TS.

629
00:43:01,954 --> 00:43:04,290
Wow, he's so full of himself.

630
00:43:06,584 --> 00:43:09,336
Oh man. Where'd that punk go?

631
00:43:11,797 --> 00:43:12,881
-Punk!
-You scared me!

632
00:43:12,965 --> 00:43:14,341
-Come with me.
-No, Hee-chan.

633
00:43:14,425 --> 00:43:15,926
-Just five minutes.
-Five minutes?

634
00:43:16,010 --> 00:43:16,844
-Are you sick?
-No.

635
00:43:16,927 --> 00:43:18,304
Why are you in the hospital?

636
00:43:21,265 --> 00:43:22,516
Bo-bae.

637
00:43:23,017 --> 00:43:25,811
I'm sorry. Something urgent came up.

638
00:43:25,894 --> 00:43:27,396
When's the surgery?

639
00:43:27,479 --> 00:43:28,314
Oh man.

640
00:43:28,397 --> 00:43:31,191
You and your Bo-bae. You're obsessed.

641
00:43:31,275 --> 00:43:34,528
All right, then. I'll come by tomorrow.

642
00:43:35,112 --> 00:43:36,530
Yeah. Get some rest.

643
00:43:37,323 --> 00:43:38,282
Okay.

644
00:43:38,866 --> 00:43:41,660
Come by where?
Your schedule's packed tomorrow, punk.

645
00:43:41,744 --> 00:43:45,873
Why'd you suddenly take off?
You have no idea how much I had to grovel.

646
00:43:46,832 --> 00:43:47,666
Hee-chan.

647
00:43:49,001 --> 00:43:52,713
You knew I was meeting
Baek Ho-rang today, didn't you?

648
00:43:52,796 --> 00:43:56,091
What? "Baekho"? Like a tiger?
What are you talking about?

649
00:43:58,302 --> 00:43:59,345
I told you.

650
00:43:59,428 --> 00:44:02,014
I don't mind promoting
my movies and dramas,

651
00:44:02,097 --> 00:44:04,683
but I told you
I won't use my image for commercials.

652
00:44:04,767 --> 00:44:07,895
-You said you'd keep them off my back.
-I did, but…

653
00:44:08,979 --> 00:44:10,439
Turns out I couldn't do much.

654
00:44:12,399 --> 00:44:14,443
Don't set up another meeting like that.

655
00:44:16,195 --> 00:44:19,698
Find out who Ji Eun-ho visited earlier.

656
00:44:19,782 --> 00:44:21,158
Yes, sir.

657
00:44:21,659 --> 00:44:23,118
Excuse me.

658
00:44:25,746 --> 00:44:26,914
You again!

659
00:44:28,040 --> 00:44:30,250
I've been thinking about you
all this time.

660
00:44:30,876 --> 00:44:33,796
-Did you come to see me?
-This is highly inappropriate.

661
00:44:33,879 --> 00:44:37,091
So did you feel a tingle later?

662
00:44:37,174 --> 00:44:39,009
I told you I didn't feel a thing.

663
00:44:39,093 --> 00:44:40,260
Really?

664
00:44:40,761 --> 00:44:42,513
-I knew it.
-Move aside.

665
00:44:43,931 --> 00:44:45,015
Step aside!

666
00:44:45,099 --> 00:44:45,933
Oh no, sorry.

667
00:44:46,016 --> 00:44:47,184
I'm sorry!

668
00:44:50,062 --> 00:44:52,856
Wait. Just a moment.

669
00:44:52,940 --> 00:44:53,899
You see…

670
00:44:53,982 --> 00:44:56,568
I know this is going to sound weird,

671
00:44:56,652 --> 00:45:02,282
but you're the first person I've ever met
who's like a rubber glove.

672
00:45:02,366 --> 00:45:03,909
Can we talk for a moment?

673
00:45:04,952 --> 00:45:05,953
I have an appointment.

674
00:45:06,620 --> 00:45:07,871
Then your number.

675
00:45:07,955 --> 00:45:10,499
Can I at least have your number?

676
00:45:10,582 --> 00:45:13,585
If you don't have time,
I'll explain everything in a text.

677
00:45:13,669 --> 00:45:14,503
Please.

678
00:45:14,586 --> 00:45:18,173
Could you just hear me out this once?

679
00:45:22,970 --> 00:45:23,804
All right.

680
00:45:24,388 --> 00:45:25,639
Then…

681
00:45:27,057 --> 00:45:27,891
Your name?

682
00:45:29,059 --> 00:45:30,018
I'm Na Bo-bae.

683
00:45:30,102 --> 00:45:31,186
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

684
00:45:32,312 --> 00:45:34,773
I've heard plenty of pickup lines,

685
00:45:34,857 --> 00:45:37,651
but this kind of pathetic flirting?
That's a first.

686
00:45:39,361 --> 00:45:40,487
"Flirting"?

687
00:45:40,571 --> 00:45:43,866
One accidental kiss with a handsome guy
who looks loaded,

688
00:45:43,949 --> 00:45:45,117
and suddenly it's "fate."

689
00:45:45,200 --> 00:45:46,952
Don't you think it's a little cliché?

690
00:45:47,035 --> 00:45:49,747
Even if I touch you, I don't feel a thing.

691
00:45:49,830 --> 00:45:52,499
No tingle. No spark. No heat.

692
00:45:53,250 --> 00:45:55,377
So please stop!

693
00:46:01,592 --> 00:46:03,051
Gosh, what is he even saying?

694
00:46:03,594 --> 00:46:05,179
Honestly.

695
00:46:05,262 --> 00:46:06,221
Well done.

696
00:46:08,182 --> 00:46:10,768
You couldn't even stop
a woman in a hospital gown?

697
00:46:10,851 --> 00:46:14,188
The thing is, whenever we touched,
there was this static…

698
00:46:18,150 --> 00:46:19,318
My apologies, sir.

699
00:46:20,068 --> 00:46:21,695
-So…
-What?

700
00:46:24,031 --> 00:46:24,865
Never mind.

701
00:46:24,948 --> 00:46:27,951
I've never seen you speak so harshly
to a stranger.

702
00:46:28,035 --> 00:46:30,496
What? You call that harsh?

703
00:46:32,664 --> 00:46:35,083
You were being honest, speaking your mind.

704
00:46:35,167 --> 00:46:37,795
Just like you are with us.
No filter whatsoever.

705
00:46:37,878 --> 00:46:38,837
That's because…

706
00:46:39,421 --> 00:46:41,590
That woman was talking nonsense!

707
00:46:41,673 --> 00:46:43,884
The first person she's met
who felt like fate?

708
00:46:43,967 --> 00:46:45,010
She never said "fate."

709
00:46:45,594 --> 00:46:46,637
-She did.
-She didn't.

710
00:46:47,262 --> 00:46:49,640
She said you were like a rubber glove.

711
00:46:50,349 --> 00:46:51,642
Is that what you heard too?

712
00:46:52,351 --> 00:46:53,185
Yes.

713
00:46:54,102 --> 00:46:55,354
She must've misspoken.

714
00:46:55,437 --> 00:46:57,356
"Fate" makes more sense in this context.

715
00:46:57,856 --> 00:46:59,900
Why would she say "a rubber glove"?

716
00:46:59,983 --> 00:47:02,027
I guess that's true.

717
00:47:08,450 --> 00:47:09,535
Yes.

718
00:47:11,036 --> 00:47:12,162
Hey, Ho-rang.

719
00:47:12,246 --> 00:47:13,205
Hello.

720
00:47:14,248 --> 00:47:15,082
Good to see you.

721
00:47:28,428 --> 00:47:29,471
Cute, right?

722
00:47:29,972 --> 00:47:31,265
They're kissing gouramis.

723
00:47:31,348 --> 00:47:32,182
Look.

724
00:47:32,266 --> 00:47:34,059
They actually kiss.

725
00:47:39,523 --> 00:47:41,483
You call that a kiss?

726
00:47:41,567 --> 00:47:43,110
Nice try.

727
00:47:46,071 --> 00:47:47,406
Huh? What did you say?

728
00:47:47,489 --> 00:47:48,824
Oh, it's nothing.

729
00:47:49,324 --> 00:47:51,577
-What about the battery?
-That's right!

730
00:47:52,244 --> 00:47:53,120
Look at this.

731
00:47:53,203 --> 00:47:56,039
This is a brand-new model

732
00:47:56,123 --> 00:47:58,458
straight out of the US.

733
00:47:58,542 --> 00:48:01,879
It's nothing like the artificial hearts
we've used before.

734
00:48:04,715 --> 00:48:07,175
Since we're replacing the whole device,

735
00:48:07,259 --> 00:48:10,095
we'll have to open your chest a bit more.

736
00:48:10,178 --> 00:48:12,806
But you won't need another surgery
for a hundred years.

737
00:48:13,724 --> 00:48:17,853
A hundred years? I'll be dead,
but the battery will still be going.

738
00:48:18,770 --> 00:48:21,356
You won't have to worry
about replacing the battery again.

739
00:48:23,567 --> 00:48:24,568
I promise.

740
00:48:25,235 --> 00:48:28,447
Tomorrow will be the last surgery
I ever perform on you.

741
00:48:29,281 --> 00:48:31,074
After this surgery,

742
00:48:31,158 --> 00:48:33,785
I'm going to start preparing
to take over TS Group.

743
00:48:38,332 --> 00:48:41,084
I'm in your hands, Professor.

744
00:48:44,504 --> 00:48:48,383
Your surgery's early tomorrow,
so get a good night's sleep.

745
00:48:51,511 --> 00:48:52,429
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

746
00:48:54,389 --> 00:48:57,476
I heard Hanlim Advertising Company
landed the TS Resort ad.

747
00:48:58,060 --> 00:48:59,394
Wow, classic Hanlim.

748
00:49:00,020 --> 00:49:03,523
Seems like the company's really taken off
since Seol-hee became director.

749
00:49:04,107 --> 00:49:07,736
That's all Seol-hee. She's that capable.

750
00:49:08,236 --> 00:49:09,363
Seol-hee.

751
00:49:09,988 --> 00:49:11,114
How's the wine?

752
00:49:11,615 --> 00:49:13,533
This is Romanée-Conti--

753
00:49:13,617 --> 00:49:14,576
Sweetie!

754
00:49:17,371 --> 00:49:18,413
Pour me another.

755
00:49:23,585 --> 00:49:24,878
More.

756
00:49:28,173 --> 00:49:29,257
More.

757
00:49:29,341 --> 00:49:30,968
Hey, wine is supposed to be--

758
00:49:31,051 --> 00:49:34,721
As much as you love me!

759
00:49:47,693 --> 00:49:48,735
That's strange.

760
00:49:48,819 --> 00:49:51,363
Is this how little Si-hun loves me?

761
00:49:52,531 --> 00:49:54,366
There's barely any left, you prick.

762
00:49:54,449 --> 00:49:57,327
Oh, I see.
It's not Si-hun's love that's lacking.

763
00:49:58,245 --> 00:50:00,080
Turns out you're just small.

764
00:50:00,789 --> 00:50:02,582
You can't even fill a wine glass.

765
00:50:05,669 --> 00:50:06,878
Damn it. Hey!

766
00:50:10,048 --> 00:50:11,466
Si-hun.

767
00:50:11,550 --> 00:50:14,011
If you want to impress women,
spend a little more.

768
00:50:14,094 --> 00:50:15,971
And put a little more heart into it.

769
00:50:16,722 --> 00:50:18,306
Don't be so cheap.

770
00:50:19,725 --> 00:50:21,935
Come on, Seol-hee. I'll give you a ride.

771
00:50:22,519 --> 00:50:23,937
I'll head out first.

772
00:50:27,691 --> 00:50:28,734
Seol-hee!

773
00:50:32,154 --> 00:50:33,030
Get in.

774
00:50:33,113 --> 00:50:35,115
I don't ride with drunk drivers.

775
00:50:35,824 --> 00:50:36,867
Goodbye, Do-yoon.

776
00:50:37,367 --> 00:50:39,286
I'll just call a designated driver.

777
00:50:43,457 --> 00:50:44,291
What?

778
00:50:45,709 --> 00:50:46,543
Gonna praise me?

779
00:50:47,544 --> 00:50:48,378
Yeah?

780
00:50:52,132 --> 00:50:53,967
I did well back there, right?

781
00:50:55,010 --> 00:50:56,928
Don't be so mean to Si-hun.

782
00:50:57,012 --> 00:51:00,557
He's hitting on my sweet Seol-hee
without knowing his place.

783
00:51:00,640 --> 00:51:01,600
You do that too.

784
00:51:02,184 --> 00:51:03,435
Don't say that. It hurts.

785
00:51:03,518 --> 00:51:06,646
You think some cook's on the same level
as the director of TS Hotel?

786
00:51:08,273 --> 00:51:09,191
Do-yoon.

787
00:51:09,691 --> 00:51:13,195
To me, a loser who cooks and a loser
who rents out rooms are the same.

788
00:51:14,196 --> 00:51:17,699
Shouldn't you at least be TS Group's heir
to talk about someone's place?

789
00:51:20,660 --> 00:51:21,661
Hey, Han Seol-hee.

790
00:51:22,162 --> 00:51:23,830
Baek Ho-rang

791
00:51:24,748 --> 00:51:27,084
has no plans to marry you.

792
00:51:28,794 --> 00:51:30,212
You're not even on his radar.

793
00:51:32,756 --> 00:51:34,633
Do-yoon, make sure you call a driver.

794
00:51:35,425 --> 00:51:38,553
Don't become a public laughingstock again
over a DUI headline.

795
00:52:07,624 --> 00:52:11,002
All right. If everyone's ready,
we'll begin the procedure.

796
00:52:11,503 --> 00:52:12,337
Scalpel.

797
00:52:32,691 --> 00:52:33,733
That stings!

798
00:52:33,817 --> 00:52:36,611
I told you not to touch me
with your bare hands.

799
00:52:36,695 --> 00:52:39,156
You should always wear gloves.

800
00:52:45,829 --> 00:52:46,663
Huh?

801
00:53:20,197 --> 00:53:21,573
What? Did the power go out?

802
00:53:22,866 --> 00:53:23,825
What about the UPS?

803
00:53:23,909 --> 00:53:26,578
There's a problem.
The emergency power isn't coming on.

804
00:53:26,661 --> 00:53:28,747
Two, three minutes for the generator.
What now?

805
00:53:28,830 --> 00:53:30,498
-Quick, turn the hand crank!
-Okay!

806
00:53:41,426 --> 00:53:42,427
Nice and slow.

807
00:53:44,554 --> 00:53:46,097
Ma'am, hold on.

808
00:53:46,181 --> 00:53:48,225
Is surgery even possible in the dark?

809
00:53:48,808 --> 00:53:52,854
Don't hospitals have backup power
during blackouts?

810
00:53:52,938 --> 00:53:54,397
I'm a little scared right now.

811
00:53:54,481 --> 00:53:57,108
I'm not going to die
during an appendectomy, am I?

812
00:53:57,192 --> 00:53:59,277
Ms. Na, the emergency power is coming on.

813
00:54:23,218 --> 00:54:26,346
I think the lights are coming back on
because of me.

814
00:54:30,183 --> 00:54:31,226
SURGERY IN PROGRESS

815
00:54:31,309 --> 00:54:33,895
I think the power's back because of me.

816
00:54:45,907 --> 00:54:47,367
Cardiac arrest!

817
00:54:47,993 --> 00:54:49,661
Another mil of epi!

818
00:55:03,425 --> 00:55:05,010
Vitals are stable.

819
00:55:05,510 --> 00:55:07,178
Blood pressure's good. 120 over 80.

820
00:55:07,262 --> 00:55:08,096
Okay.

821
00:55:08,680 --> 00:55:09,514
Reduce the flow.

822
00:55:10,223 --> 00:55:11,808
Closing the chest.

823
00:55:26,364 --> 00:55:27,198
Huh?

824
00:55:57,812 --> 00:55:58,646
Huh?

825
00:56:06,237 --> 00:56:07,280
What's going on?

826
00:56:09,157 --> 00:56:11,117
Why is he here again?

827
00:56:15,288 --> 00:56:16,122
Excuse me.

828
00:56:23,838 --> 00:56:24,923
Excuse me.

829
00:56:46,820 --> 00:56:47,946
Excuse me.

830
00:57:18,268 --> 00:57:20,145
Wow, this is so strange.

831
00:57:21,020 --> 00:57:23,106
Why doesn't my electricity affect him?

832
00:57:26,693 --> 00:57:30,029
If this guy really is my rubber glove,

833
00:57:30,780 --> 00:57:35,493
does that mean I can touch him
and even date him?

834
00:59:41,369 --> 00:59:45,665
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
